# AoC 2024 day 10: trailhead scores and ratings over a height map. A trail
# climbs by exactly one at each step; a score counts the summits reachable and
# a rating counts the distinct routes to them.
sheet is Source as pattern

height k is cell sheet k | otherwise '.' | ord | sub _ 48

up k is around4 sheet k | sift (n : eq (add (height k) 1) (height n))

reach k is
  pick (eq 9 (height k))
    (circle [k])
    (up k | bend reach | braid union (circle []))

rating k is pick (eq 9 (height k)) 1 (up k | bend rating | sum)

heads is sheet | knots | sift (k : eq 0 (height k))

[heads | bend (k : len (reach k)) | sum, heads | bend rating | sum]
  | bend air
  | join "\n"
